      <div type="clause" n="13">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 13</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Utlaga. Se ðe útlages weorc gewyrce wealde se cyng ðæs friðes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Outlawry. If anyone does the deed of an outlaw, the king alone shall have power to grant him security.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe utlages weorc gewyrce, wealde se cingc þæs friþes.</ab>
